%%{init: {"sequence":{"mirrorActors":false,"wrap":true,"width":150,"actorMargin":30,"boxMargin":6,"messageMargin":16,"noteMargin":6,"diagramMarginX":8,"diagramMarginY":8}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Solicitante
  actor T as Tecnico
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant CTRL as RoosterDesk<br/>Controller
  participant SVC as RoosterDesk<br/>Service
  participant WS as Mensagens<br/>Gateway
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S->>FE: descreve o problema
  FE->>CTRL: POST /chamados
  CTRL->>SVC: validateTicketClassification()
  SVC->>DB: cria Ticket status=Aberto
  CTRL-->>FE: 201

  T->>FE: assume o chamado
  FE->>CTRL: PATCH /chamados/:id/atribuir
  CTRL->>SVC: verifica tecnico pertence ao setor
  SVC->>DB: atualiza tecnicoId e cria HistoricoTicket (RN009)

  T->>FE: responde ao solicitante
  FE->>CTRL: POST /chamados/:id/mensagens
  CTRL->>SVC: createMensagemChamado()
  SVC->>DB: cria MensagemTicket
  CTRL->>WS: emite o evento apos gravar
  WS-->>FE: mensagem aparece na conversa do solicitante

  T->>FE: encerra o chamado
  FE->>CTRL: PATCH /chamados/:id/status
  CTRL->>CTRL: statusTransitionAction()<br/>exige 'encerrar' (RN005)
  CTRL->>CTRL: derivarEncerradoEm()<br/>(RN006)
  CTRL->>SVC: grava status, encerradoEm e historico
